    "description": "You treat a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Siang_Lance\" title=\"Siang Lance\">Siang Lance</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rifle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rifle\">Rifle</a> instead of as an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Ranged)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon (Ranged)\">Exotic Weapon (Ranged)</a>. Additionally, you gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Siang_Lance\" title=\"Siang Lance\">Siang Lance</a>. This Talent counts as the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Siang_Lance)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Focus (Siang Lance)\">Weapon Focus (Siang Lance)</a> feat for the purpose of satisfying prerequisites.<br><br>If you also have the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Rifles)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Focus (Rifles)\">Weapon Focus (Rifles)</a> feat, the attack bonus provided by this Talent does not stack with the attack bonus provided by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Rifles)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Focus (Rifles)\">Weapon Focus (Rifles)</a>.",
